---
---
<section id="nosotros" class="about-section" aria-labelledby="about-title">
  <div class="about-container">
    <div class="about-intro">
      <div class="about-copy">
        <span class="about-eyebrow"><span class="about-eyebrow-line"></span> SOBRE NOSOTROS</span>
        <h2 id="about-title">Conectamos generaciones, <span>creamos compañía.</span></h2>
        <p class="about-lead">Creemos que acompañar es mucho más que estar presente: es escuchar, compartir y hacer que cada momento cuente.</p>
        <p class="about-description">SeniorLink nace con el propósito de acercar a las personas mayores y sus familias a estudiantes y acompañantes comprometidos. Queremos facilitar el apoyo cotidiano mediante una experiencia cercana, organizada y transparente.</p>
        <a class="about-link" href="#como-funciona">Descubre cómo funciona</a>
      </div>

      <div class="about-visual">
        <img src="/actividades/charla.png" alt="Personas compartiendo un momento de conversación y compañía" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
        <div class="about-image-shade"></div>
        <div class="about-visual-note">
          
          <div><strong>La compañía transforma momentos en recuerdos.</strong></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="about-values" aria-label="Nuestros pilares">
      <article class="about-value">
        <span class="about-value-number">01 /</span>
        <div class="about-value-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20.8 4.6a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.8 0L12 5.7l-1.1-1.1a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.8 7.8L12 21l8.8-8.6a5.5 5.5 0 0 0 0-7.8Z"/></svg></div>
        <h3>Trato humano</h3>
        <p>Promovemos la empatía, la escucha activa y el respeto por el ritmo de cada persona.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="about-value">
        <span class="about-value-number">02 /</span>
        <div class="about-value-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10Z"/><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"/></svg></div>
        <h3>Confianza y claridad</h3>
        <p>Buscamos ofrecer información clara sobre los perfiles, las reservas y las tarifas.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="about-value">
        <span class="about-value-number">03 /</span>
        <div class="about-value-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="9" cy="8" r="3"/><path d="M3 20v-2a6 6 0 0 1 12 0v2M16 5a3 3 0 0 1 0 6m2 9v-2a6 6 0 0 0-3-5.2"/></svg></div>
        <h3>Conexión entre generaciones</h3>
        <p>Impulsamos encuentros enriquecedores entre estudiantes y personas mayores.</p>
      </article>
    </div>

    <div class="about-cta">
      <div class="about-cta-copy">
        <span class="about-cta-label">FORMA PARTE DE SENIORLINK</span>
        <h3>Tu tiempo puede marcar la diferencia.</h3>
        <p>Si eres estudiante o acompañante, conoce cómo unirte y compartir tu vocación de servicio.</p>
      </div>
      <a href="/registro?rol=acompanante" class="about-cta-button">Postular como acompañante</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about-section{padding:100px 0 108px;background:#f8fbf9;border-top:1px solid #e6eee9;scroll-margin-top:85px}
  .about-container{max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 28px}
  .about-intro{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.04fr .96fr;gap:74px;align-items:center}
  .about-eyebrow{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;color:#128274;font-size:11px;font-weight:850;letter-spacing:.16em}
  .about-eyebrow-line{width:24px;height:2px;background:#128274;border-radius:4px}
  .about-copy h2{max-width:580px;margin:20px 0 22px;color:#173e3a;font-size:clamp(35px,4vw,54px);font-weight:850;letter-spacing:-.045em;line-height:1.13}
  .about-copy h2 span{color:#148577}
  .about-lead{max-width:540px;color:#2d5348;font-size:17px;font-weight:650;line-height:1.75;margin:0 0 17px}
  .about-description{max-width:550px;color:#6b8178;font-size:14px;line-height:1.9;margin:0}
  .about-link{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:13px;margin-top:28px;color:#117b6e;font-size:14px;font-weight:800;text-decoration:none}
  .about-link span{display:grid;place-items:center;width:28px;height:28px;border:1px solid #c6dfd4;border-radius:50%;transition:transform .2s}
  .about-link:hover span{transform:translate(3px,-3px)}
  .about-visual{position:relative;min-height:450px;border-radius:24px;overflow:hidden;background:#dcebe4;box-shadow:0 22px 55px rgba(18,67,54,.12)}
  .about-visual>img{display:block;width:100%;height:100%;min-height:450px;position:absolute;inset:0;object-fit:cover}
  .about-image-shade{position:absolute;inset:35% 0 0;background:linear-gradient(transparent,rgba(11,52,43,.58))}
  .about-visual-note{position:absolute;bottom:24px;left:24px;right:24px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:13px;padding:15px 18px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.95);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.8);border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 8px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.09)}
  .about-note-symbol{display:grid;place-items:center;width:42px;height:42px;flex-shrink:0;background:#e3f4eb;color:#128274;border-radius:12px;font-size:29px}
  .about-visual-note strong{display:block;color:#174a3d;font-size:14px}
  .about-visual-note div>span{display:block;color:#6b8178;font-size:12px;margin-top:4px}
  .about-values{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:20px;margin-top:64px}
  .about-value{position:relative;min-width:0;padding:27px 27px 29px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e0ece5;border-radius:17px;box-shadow:0 6px 22px rgba(20,70,60,.035);transition:transform .2s,border-color .2s,box-shadow .2s}
  .about-value:hover{transform:translateY(-4px);border-color:#b8d9ca;box-shadow:0 15px 32px rgba(20,70,60,.09)}
  .about-value-number{position:absolute;right:25px;top:28px;color:#a5c7b7;font-size:11px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.08em}
  .about-value-icon{display:grid;place-items:center;width:48px;height:48px;background:#e9f6ef;color:#128274;border-radius:13px}
  .about-value-icon svg{width:24px;height:24px}
  .about-value h3{margin:21px 0 9px;color:#1d493e;font-size:17px;font-weight:800}
  .about-value p{margin:0;color:#72867d;font-size:13px;line-height:1.8}
  .about-cta{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:30px;margin-top:25px;padding:35px 42px;border-radius:19px;background:linear-gradient(110deg,#126b5e,#0e514a);color:#fff}
  .about-cta-label{color:#a8e2cf;font-size:10px;font-weight:850;letter-spacing:.14em}
  .about-cta h3{margin:10px 0 8px;font-size:clamp(22px,2.4vw,29px);font-weight:850;letter-spacing:-.025em}
  .about-cta p{margin:0;color:#d3eae1;font-size:13px;line-height:1.7}
  .about-cta-button{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:16px;flex-shrink:0;padding:15px 19px;background:#fff;color:#116a5e;text-align:center;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;text-decoration:none;border-radius:11px;transition:background .2s,transform .2s}
  .about-cta-button:hover{background:#e9f8f0;transform:translateY(-2px)}
  @media(max-width:980px){.about-intro{gap:32px}.about-visual,.about-visual>img{min-height:380px}.about-cta{padding:30px}}
  @media(max-width:760px){.about-section{padding:66px 0 72px}.about-container{padding:0 18px}.about-intro{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:32px}.about-copy h2{font-size:clamp(32px,8vw,43px)}.about-lead{font-size:15px}.about-visual,.about-visual>img{min-height:330px}.about-visual-note{left:14px;right:14px;bottom:14px}.about-values{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:13px;margin-top:32px}.about-value{padding:23px}.about-value h3{margin-top:15px}.about-cta{flex-direction:column;align-items:stretch;gap:22px;margin-top:16px;padding:28px 24px}.about-cta-button{width:100%}}
  @media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.about-link span,.about-value,.about-cta-button{transition:none}.about-value:hover,.about-cta-button:hover,.about-link:hover span{transform:none}}
</style>